#   internal/connect          probes the --url the user gives, the user's own server.
#   internal/servecheck       `serve check`: the base URL the user gives.
#   internal/serveapp/admin_cli  a Unix socket.
#   internal/inproc, server   http.Header and a doc comment; no network.

